OL,3,GNEWSASikh charity's plea to end
OL,4,Achurch-only rule blocked
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity's bid to overturn a historic
OL,7,Frule that prevents a former church from
OL,8,Fbeing converted has been rejected.
OL,10,FThe Miri Piri Afghan Charitable Trust
OL,11,Fhad asked for the removal of a
OL,12,F44-year-old restriction on the former
OL,13,FWednesfield Methodist Church on Wood
OL,14,FEnd Road, Wolverhampton, which limits
OL,15,Fits use to a church and hall.
OL,17,FA previous bid to convert it into a
OL,18,FSikh temple was turned down by the city
OL,19,Fcouncil in 2024 over concerns it would
OL,20,Fincrease traffic in an already
OL,21,Fcongested area.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
