OL,3,GNEWSASikh charity's plea to end
OL,4,Achurch-only rule blocked
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The council considers that the
OL,7,Fcondition continues to serve a planning
OL,8,Fpurpose by limiting the scale, nature
OL,9,Fand intensity of the use undertaken
OL,10,Ffrom the site," planners said in
OL,11,Frejecting the latest application.
